  "notes": "- Quest log on the right of the screen: the map's objective and its side quest, each step ticked off as\n  you go (with counts like keycards 2/3 and the time left to hold the control room).\n- Story cards are side cards now: map intros, quest hints and intel slide in on the left like the event\n  pop-ups, instead of a block of text at the top of the screen.\n- Camo picker redone: small swatches five to a row, grouped (camos, weapon prestige, prestige, map quests)\n  with a count each; hover one to see its name and what unlocks it.\n- Prestige camos 2-10 now need that prestige (they were unlocked for everyone by mistake). One you\n  picked early goes back to the factory finish until you get there.\n- Rattler: the drum mag no longer pokes up through the gun in front of the sights, and the bulky rear\n  sight drum is gone, so aiming down the sights is a clear view over the front post.",
